{"metadata":{"category":"Orange Unified Design System","role":"project","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","title":"Going further with more resources"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[{"chapter":"Go further with more ressources","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"image":"ic_theme_intro.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Going further with more resources","kind":"hero","backgroundImage":"ic_theme_intro.png"},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"title":"More resources","contentSection":[{"kind":"contentAndMedia","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode can use the Swift DocC documentation of OUDS, and this documentation is used to build a static web site."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"But there are also other resources which can be useful for you."}]}],"mediaPosition":"trailing"}],"anchor":"More-resources","stepsSection":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The iOS technical documentation is available online. It has been generated from all the Swift DocC documentation written in the Swift Package.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You will find several catalogs (as many as libraries) with details about everything: components, tokens, themes, providers, etc.","type":"text"}]}],"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-1.png","type":"step","code":null,"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can get it at "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/","isActive":true}]}],"runtimePreview":null},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The whole design system is documented and available online. You can find everything about components, tokens, guidelines and principles of OUDS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"icon finder"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" is also available there to get icons for your projects."}]}],"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-2.png","type":"step","code":null,"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Go to the website and learn things at ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com\/","type":"reference"}]}],"runtimePreview":null},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS iOS provides also a wiki attached to its GitHub repository. The wiki is a public base of knowledge with plenty of things: available API, technical architecture, tips about processes, tests, conventions and toolings.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-3.png","type":"step","code":null,"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Have a look ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki","isActive":true},{"text":" to discover how OUDS works.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"runtimePreview":null},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For technical reasons the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" GitHub repository does not embed the source code of the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"design system toolbox"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" app. In fact this app and all its snapshots for tests increases a lot the size of the repository.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To get the source code of this showcase app, go to its dedicated GitHub repository at "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-4.png","code":null,"runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not hesitate to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/issues","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/discussions","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"!"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS is open source, public and uses GitHub as forge. Thus, you will find common things inside the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" GitHub repository."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-5.png","code":null,"runtimePreview":null}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"modules":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-libraries","projects":[{"sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-libraries#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-libraries#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-libraries"}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Define-information-cards","projects":[{"sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUD